    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Winnie-the-Pooh's book writing speedrunner is an exciting game that challenges players to write the entire original Winnie-the-Pooh book chapter by chapter, all while racing against the clock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.poster.avif?t=1745408009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.webm?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.mp4?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this game, players are tasked with writing the complete 10 chapters as quickly as possible, with their time being tracked and recorded for competition with other players around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.poster.avif?t=1745408009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.webm?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.mp4?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Winnie-the-Pooh's book writing speedrunner is an exciting game that challenges players to write the entire original Winnie-the-Pooh book chapter by chapter, all while racing against the clock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.poster.avif?t=1745408009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.webm?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/80669f071430ad36fed46e695334dda0.mp4?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this game, players are tasked with writing the complete 10 chapters as quickly as possible, with their time being tracked and recorded for competition with other players around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.poster.avif?t=1745408009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.webm?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340790/extras/43459b5340108a64a154a4e8e727578a.mp4?t=1745408009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
